# Golden eval datasets — one JSON file per workload
#
# Each file is a JSON array of test cases with fields:
#   - input: str              (user query / event text)
#   - actual_output: str      (LLM response to evaluate)
#   - expected_output: str    (golden / ideal response)
#   - retrieval_context: [str] (contexts retrieved by RAG pipeline)
#
# Datasets are added by each workload on merge:
#   - Day 30: W1 event ingestion dataset
#   - Day 31+: W2, W3, W6 datasets
